      </div>
      <img src="/images/lnp/live_08.png" alt="Customer Enrollment Completion" class="project-image" loading="lazy" />

      <h3>The Business Impact</h3>
      <p>By removing the time-barrier at the lane, enrollment skyrocketed, resulting in $60M in incremental year-over-year margin.</p>
      <p>In analyzing the complex use cases, we were able to build a seamless system that would address duplicates, fraud, and attempts at gaming the system. The successful launch of this initiative converted in 25,000 incremental enrollments every week.</p>

