      <h2>Case Study: Single Transaction ExtraCare Plus Upgrade</h2>

      <h3>The Problem</h3>
      <p>ExtraCare Plus (our paid premium loyalty tier) had an onboarding experience that was disconnected from the checkout loop. Customers in store had to void their transactions, initiate an enrollment and then restart their checkout. This de-incentivized customers who wanted to enroll in ExtraCare Plus, and prompted colleagues to convince them it was not worth it.</p>

      <h3>The UX Intervention</h3>
      <p>I rearchitected the premium upgrade flow to live within the checkout transaction, allowing the premium subscription to be added as an SKU.</p>

      <h3>The Business Impact</h3>
      <p>Transformed a complex billing onboarding flow into a seamless, contextual, one-tap decision point, radically increasing premium conversion rates at checkout.</p>

