      <p>In addition to facilitating In-Store enrollments, we also analyzed ways to include these rewards in the web and app experiences for CVS, bringing loyalty closer to the customer's lives. We created ways to track, utilized and understand these rewards in the digital shop experience.</p>
      <p>Additionally, we created ways to seamlessly opt in while enrolling in the base ExtraCare program, and prevent account duplications while doing so.</p>

