      <h2>Case Study: Gamification, Punch Cards and Badges</h2>

      <h3>The Problem</h3>
      <p>While ExtraCare had massive passive enrollment, we needed a modern UX lever to drive daily active engagement and habit-forming behaviors inside our digital products.</p>

      <h3>The UX Intervention</h3>
      <p>I led the end-to-end ideation, visual design, and software implementation of CVS's major in-app gamification launch. I designed immersive, interactive scratch-and-win and milestone-tracking interfaces that rewarded users for completing healthy micro-habits and retail tasks.</p>

      <h3>The Creative Alignment</h3>
      <p>Beyond the screen, I served as the central strategic node, aligning the in-app gamified animations directly with direct-to-consumer email marketing campaigns, physical in-store signage, and CRM push notifications to build a unified narrative.</p>

